220	     * when an {@link #getEmail() email} is present; adds {@code 1} when {@link #getNamesakeCount()
221	     * namesakeCount} is {@code 0}; capped at {@code 3} (level {@code 4} is reserved for tenure).
222	     * Not persisted — derived from {@link #getEmail()} and {@link #getNamesakeCount()}.
223	     */
224	    @Transient
